<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Splash mark. The splash window shows this over a background that flips with the system theme, so
  the logo carries its own indigo tile and keeps the same contrast in light and dark.

  Sized on the 288dp splash canvas with the artwork inside the inner two thirds, per the
  SplashScreen API's icon guidance.
-->
